<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-25T12:40:45.214Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:40:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Burkina Faso junta has restored the death penalty for terrorism, treason and high crimes, while its army and Russian mercenaries are linked to new civilian killings, including the discovery of 54 bodies in Tagadayat and strikes across three regions. In Nigeria, gunmen on motorcycles killed at least 20 people in a village and separate gunmen killed at least 10 people in eastern Nigeria, while suspected bandits killed 37 people in a Taraba border community. Two European women who had been held captive for more than a year in Niger were freed in Libya. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1fT3Y1SmgzVkgwcldVSEE4TVhadm1LeXhkeW1hclBrMFNyQ0JPYXZhOWc5ZGNVTHVwRE9kcFRXa1d2d283YkdHZFhEVW02UHhkWThWclY4eVlpUjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPWGktY3hfblNpdUZFbFJTRlRFOHZIb3lYcmphenEwQ21rUUMxbkdIdjNPbkxvaU9tdmdxTTgzSENSRFBMU2xkS1h0NHhEZ3lJWVVKc3FxSU94cm0wM3lRbnF4T3FUSnVEQ3ZNOVNUdXBDd1gyeHEzbXlLQkFfcXBEUWp1UXJXeC1KNTZxZ2JfNGVlRjUyUXpvTnNFRXJkLThtdEFncUFTMy1yMFFDRVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Citizen Digital&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOcFloT